      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FORT WILLIAM (4) looks well placed here. Placed here in higher grade two back then was not far away in town last time. Back to the right grade and expected to go close. ROYAL BOMBADIER (7) wasn't far away here two back then just missed here latest. Expected to be in the finish again. UPSTART LOVER (10) was on speed and lifted strongly to score fresh at Ipswich. Started favourite here on the back of that and led but was swamped badly late. Change of rider with a senior going on and well worth another chance. OVER DRAFT (5) was fourth and beaten only a length two back then headed north and was just nabbed at Rocky. Goes well here and is close to a win. NORTH OF ELI (2) is back in grade and up in trip. Can improve.",
